<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Wesfarmers shares leap after profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Wesfarmers shares leap after profit.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in West Australian-based rural and energy group, Wesfarmers Ltd, leapt 30 cents to A$9.70 on Tuesday, their highest level since April 1995, following Monday's well-received first half profit result.</p>
<p>Wesfarmers reported a 47.8 percent higher net profit of A$90.3 million for the six months ending December 31, 1996 and increased their interim dividend to 20 cents per share from 17 cents.</p>
</text>
